cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these addresses, the engine or the paper, please cite them as below."
title: "N-Ways Addressing for Côte d'Ivoire"
abstract: "An address for every compound of Côte d'Ivoire: the name of a quartier, village or cité people already use and a number of four or five digits read in pairs, unique in the whole country on its own; the official address first wherever the State has given one. The repository holds the model, the reference engine, the registry of 7,956,622 issued codes and a server that publishes them."
type: dataset
